      <trans-unit id="sys_template" approved="yes">
        <source>TypoScript record</source>
        <target state="final">ຂໍ້ມູນ TypoScript</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.title" approved="yes">
        <source>Title</source>
        <target state="final">ຫົວຂໍ້</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.root" approved="yes">
        <source>Rootlevel</source>
        <target state="final">ລະດັບຮາກ</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.rootDescription" approved="yes">
        <source>When enabled, the page is marked as "Rootline Root". This is most often set only once for the uppermost TypoScript record.
				This can be used in frontend to stop at this page when creating for example "breadcrumb" menus, even if there are further parent pages. The flag especially
				affects these TypoScript "getText" properties: "level", "levelmedia", "leveltitle", "levelfield" and "leveluid".</source>
        <target state="final">ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ໜ້າເວັບຈະຖືກໝາຍວ່າເປັນ "ຮາກຂອງສາຍຮາກ (Rootline Root)". ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ TypoScript ທີ່ຢູ່ລະດັບສູງສຸດ.
			ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການສະແດງຜົນສ່ວນໜ້າຢຸດຢູ່ທີ່ໜ້ານີ້ ເມື່ອສ້າງເມນູປະເພດ "breadcrumb", ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະມີໜ້າຫຼັກຢູ່ຂັ້ນເທິງກໍຕາມ. ຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນໂດຍຕົງຕໍ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ "getText" ຂອງ TypoScript ດັ່ງນີ້: "level", "levelmedia", "leveltitle", "levelfield" ແລະ "leveluid".</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.clear" approved="yes">
        <source>Clear</source>
        <target state="final">ລຶບລ້າງ</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.clearDescription" approved="yes">
        <source>Remove TypoScript settings from TypoScript records up in rootline. This is most often set only once for the uppermost TypoScript record that is most often
			 	located on the same page that has "Use as Root Page" flag set and the "Site" configuration attached in the site module.</source>
        <target state="final">ລຶບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ TypoScript ຈາກຂໍ້ມູນ TypoScript ທີ່ຢູ່ຂັ້ນເທິງໃນສາຍຮາກ. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນ TypoScript ທີ່ຢູ່ສູງສຸດ ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະຢູ່ໃນໜ້າດຽວກັນກັບໜ້າທີ່ຖືກໝາຍວ່າ "ໃຊ້ເປັນໜ້າຮາກ" ແລະ ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "ເວັບໄຊ (Site)".</target>
      </trans-unit>
