        <target state="final">ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Setup)</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.static_file_mode" approved="yes">
        <source>Loading order of TypoScript sets</source>
        <target state="final">ລຳດັບການໂຫລດຂອງຊຸດ TypoScript</target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="sys_template.static_file_modeDescription" approved="yes">
        <source>This seldom used feature affects if and when TypoScript sets from extensions (ext_typoscript_setup.typoscript and ext_typoscript_constants.typoscript)
				are loaded. There are very few cases where setting this to a different value than the default value "0" is useful.</source>
        <target state="final">ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ບໍ່ຄ່ອຍໄດ້ໃຊ້, ມັນມີຜົນຕໍ່ກັບເວລາໃນການໂຫລດຊຸດ TypoScript ຈາກສ່ວນເສີມ. ມີໜ້ອຍກໍລະນີຫຼາຍທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຢ່າງອື່ນນອກຈາກຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "0".</target>
      </trans-unit>
